{"id":"curiosidad","lemma":"curiosidad","pos":"noun","rank":1618,"glosses":["curiosity"],"ipa":"/kuɾjosiˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"curiosidades"},"order":1670,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-curiosidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"La curiosidad mató al gato.","en":"Curiosity killed the cat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/537847","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to kill, slay","l":"matar"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"cat"}]},{"text":"Lo hizo simplemente por curiosidad.","en":"He did it simply out of curiosity.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1189063","words":[{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"simply"},{"g":"for / by"},null]},{"text":"Solo tengo curiosidad.","en":"I'm just curious.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77105","words":[{"g":"sole"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null]}]}